OL,3,GNEWSAWaste centre near homes approved
OL,4,Adespite concern
OL,5,
OL,6,FA waste processing facility in a
OL,7,FLincolnshire town has been approved
OL,8,Fdespite concerns it is too close to
OL,9,Flocal housing.
OL,11,FClean Planet Energy has been granted
OL,12,Fpermission to build a waste plastic
OL,13,Fprocessing plant on land at Sleaford
OL,14,FMoor Enterprise Park.
OL,16,FSpeaking at a meeting on Monday,
OL,17,FCouncillor Steve Clegg said he did not
OL,18,Fbelieve there had been "meaningful
OL,19,Fcommunity engagement" with people
OL,20,Fliving on the nearby Holdingham Grange
OL,21,Fhousing development.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
